   CR-XX -> RF-XX -> XX-TS -> SC-XX sub-path; added missing BE-TS, DB-TS,
   FE-TS, MD-TS to Flow/Dependencies; added RF-XX (conditional) and
   SC-XX; AN now depends uniformly on all six SC-XX; added rf_skipped
   tracking to StepState)
  (Phase 155 v2: reordered sub-path to CR-XX -> RF-XX -> SC-XX -> XX-TS
   — scoped security now PRECEDES branch tests (security-first,
   fail-fast); added FTS (Final Test Suite) between the branch join and
   AN; AN now depends on FTS; added flow_version to StepState and
   [DL1-7]/[DL1-8]; v1 persisted runs deprecated, re-initialized not
   resumed)
